                                "text": "Ialso play as straight soprano on a taïwanese \"Cleveland\" srictly copied on MK VI (the real ones, notre the 6.5 models after #210.000): it's a fine horn, for tuning, tone, mechanics, much better than the Selmer Serie II I resold after few monthes as too heavy with no \"soul\""
